# Newsletter signups (Brevo, double opt-in). Set these in Vercel → Settings →
# Environment Variables. Without them the signup form says signups are not on yet.
#
# 1. Brevo → Contacts → Lists: create a list, e.g. "StockAPY Weekly". Its ID is the number in the list's URL.
# 2. Brevo → Campaigns → Templates: create a template of type "Double opt-in"
#    (it must contain the {{ doubleoptin }} confirmation link). Its ID is shown in the template list.
# 3. Brevo → SMTP & API → API keys: create a key.
# 4. Brevo → Senders, Domains: authenticate stockapy.xyz so the confirmation email is delivered.
BREVO_API_KEY=
BREVO_LIST_ID=
BREVO_DOI_TEMPLATE_ID=
